{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flappy Lord \u2013 Keep the 200 Kilos in the air!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face an absurd challenge: Control &quot;the Lord,&quot; an exceptionally heavy bird with big ambitions but minimal aerodynamics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master \u2013 timing and precision will decide whether you succeed or fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/273bc2346db010bf02adaedcea6a93cb.poster.avif?t=1757004177\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/273bc2346db010bf02adaedcea6a93cb.webm?t=1757004177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/273bc2346db010bf02adaedcea6a93cb.mp4?t=1757004177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards &amp; Highscore Hunting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against players from all over the world and prove your skills. Will you become a Meddler or a Jester?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay accompanied by the finest Meddl</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your flight attempts are accompanied by the best variations of the &quot;L\u00fcgenlord&quot; song.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Integration, Achievements &amp; In-Game Shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect achievements, climb the ranks on the leaderboards, and unlock additional content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class